<title>USA: Tarrant County, Texas, deal yields 5.7 pct in 2015.</title>
<headline>Tarrant County, Texas, deal yields 5.7 pct in 2015.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Southwest Co said Wednesday it tentatively priced $9.5 million Tarrant County Junior College District, Texas, general obligation bonds at a top yield of 5.70 percent in 2015.</p>
